  "proxy_disclosure": "LEXICAL PROXY, cutting BOTH ways, restated wherever this number is cited. Pessimistic in the ranking function: token overlap cannot follow paraphrase the way a dense encoder can, so a dense ranker over the same facets would place at least some gold-tool facets higher. Optimistic in the query representation: the query text is the manifest transcript of the spoken command, while at runtime the controller sees only a speech-derived percept. Neither direction dominates, so this is a ceiling on the LEXICAL channel conditioned on a PERFECT TRANSCRIPT, and the gate treats it as a necessary condition, never a sufficient one.",
